# The dialogue of Doctor Heri, the doctor of the Augmentation Clinic.
# It gives the Augmentation intro quest and takes the report at its end.
#
# EVERY LINE HERE IS A PLACEHOLDER. Nick owns the lore and the names. Each
# line says what happens in the beat, as a stage direction, and nothing more.
#
# The start cue routes on the quest step. Each step has one cue.

~ start
if quest.is_complete("augmentation_intro")
	=> post_quest
elif quest.on_step("augmentation_intro", "recruit")
	=> recruit
elif quest.on_step("augmentation_intro", "report")
	=> report
elif quest.is_active("augmentation_intro")
	=> waiting
{{npc.header}}
{{npc.name}}: [Placeholder: {{npc.name}} greets the player and hints at a job.]
- Placeholder: ask about the job. => offer
- Placeholder: leave. => END

~ offer
if not quest.is_available("augmentation_intro")
	{{npc.name}}: [Placeholder: The job is already taken.]
	- Right. => start
{{npc.name}}: [Placeholder: {{npc.name}} explains that augments go missing from the Clinic, and asks the player to find out who stole them.]
{{quest.accept_prompt("augmentation_intro")}}
- Accept: {{quest.title("augmentation_intro")}}
	do quest.accept("augmentation_intro")
	do message.success("You take the job.")
	=> recruit
- Not yet. => END

# The brief. The talk target fires here: the recruit step is done when the
# player had this conversation.
~ recruit
do quest.talk("augmentation_intro", "npc_aug_clinic_1")
{{npc.name}}: [Placeholder: {{npc.name}} gives the brief: the trail of the missing augments points at the Public Hospital.]
{{quest.objectives("augmentation_intro")}}
- Placeholder: agree and go. => END

# The Augmentation Clinic doctor waits for the report. No target fires here.
~ waiting
{{npc.name}}: [Placeholder: {{npc.name}} asks whether the player has tracked down the missing augments yet.]
{{quest.objectives("augmentation_intro")}}
- Placeholder: not yet. => END

# The report, with two closing responses: the truth and a cover story. Both
# complete the quest. Nick decides whether they differ. The last target fires
# under the response, so the reward comes after the player read the scene.
~ report
{{npc.name}}: [Placeholder: {{npc.name}} asks for the report.]
- Placeholder: tell the truth about the Hospital.
	do quest.talk("augmentation_intro", "npc_aug_clinic_1_end")
	=> post_quest
- Placeholder: give a cover story.
	do quest.talk("augmentation_intro", "npc_aug_clinic_1_end")
	=> post_quest

~ post_quest
{{npc.name}}: [Placeholder: {{npc.name}} thanks the player, and mentions the AugBot and Locus.]
- Placeholder: leave. => END

~ farewell
{{npc.name}}: [Placeholder farewell of the Clinic doctor.]
